#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.0-alpha.5.rst:2
msgid "Version 4.0.0-alpha.5"
msgstr "버전 4.0.0-alpha.5"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.0-alpha.5.rst:4
msgid "Release Date: Jan 30, 2019"
msgstr "출시일: 2019년 1월 30일"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.0-alpha.5.rst:6
msgid "**Next alpha release of CodeIgniter4**"
msgstr "**CodeIgniter4\ 의 다음 알파 릴리스**"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.0-alpha.5.rst:13
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "주요 사항"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.0-alpha.5.rst:15
msgid "added $maxQueries setting to app/Config/Toolbar.php"
msgstr "app/Config/Toolbar.php에 $maxQueries 설정 추가됨"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.0-alpha.5.rst:16
msgid "updated PHP dependency to 7.2"
msgstr "PHP 의존성이 7.2로 업데이트됨"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.0-alpha.5.rst:17
msgid ""
"new feature branches have been created for the email and queue modules, "
"so they don't impact the release of 4.0.0"
msgstr "이메일 및 큐 모듈을 위한 새로운 기능 브랜치가 생성되어 4.0.0 릴리스에 영향을 주지 않습니다"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.0-alpha.5.rst:18
msgid ""
"dropped several language messages that were unused (eg "
"Migrations.missingTable) and added some new (eg Migrations.invalidType)"
msgstr "사용되지 않는 언어 메시지 일부가 제거되고(예: Migrations.missingTable) 새로운 메시지가 추가됨(예: Migrations.invalidType)"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.0-alpha.5.rst:19
msgid "lots of bug fixes, especially for the database support"
msgstr "특히 데이터베이스 지원과 관련된 다수의 버그 수정"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.0-alpha.5.rst:20
msgid ""
"provided filters (CSRF, Honeypot, DebugToolbar) have been moved from "
"app/Filters/ to system/Filters/"
msgstr "제공되는 필터(CSRF, Honeypot, DebugToolbar)\ 가 app/Filters/에서 system/Filters/로 이동됨"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.0-alpha.5.rst:21
msgid "revisited the installation and tutorial sections of the user guide"
msgstr "사용자 가이드의 설치 및 튜토리얼 섹션이 재검토됨"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.0-alpha.5.rst:22
msgid "code coverage is at 77% ... getting ever closer to our target of 80% :)"
msgstr "코드 커버리지가 77%에 도달... 목표인 80%에 점점 가까워지고 있습니다 :)"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.0-alpha.5.rst:24
msgid ""
"We hope this will be the last alpha, and that the next pre-release will "
"be our first beta ... fingers crossed!"
msgstr "이번이 마지막 알파 릴리스가 되고, 다음 사전 릴리스는 첫 번째 베타가 되길 바랍니다 ... 행운을 빕니다!"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.0-alpha.5.rst:27
msgid "Changed Files"
msgstr "변경된 파일"

#: ../../source/changelogs/v4.0.0-alpha.5.rst:29
msgid "The list of changed files follows, with PR numbers shown."
msgstr "PR 번호와 함께 변경된 파일 목록이 아래에 나열됩니다."

